<title>USA: Amerac Energy names Richard Hallett CFO.</title>
<headline>Amerac Energy names Richard Hallett CFO.</headline>
<dateline>HOUSTON 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Amerac Energy said Wednesday its board of directors had elected Richard Hallett as chief financial officer of the company.  </p>
<p>A company official said Hallett, who assumed the post on January 15, replaced Jeffrey Stevens, who resigned from the post but maintained his position on the board.</p>
<p>The company said Hallett had been working as senior vice president of finance for MG Natural Gas Corp and MG Refining &amp; Marketing Inc, both of which are subsidiaries of Metallgesellschaft AG.</p>
</text>
